---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Ynvesters – AI Tools Discovery & Comparison"
  description="Ynvesters is an independent editorial site dedicated to helping professionals cut through the noise and find the AI tools that actually work."
>
  <div style="max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem;">
    <h1 style="font-size:2rem; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">About Ynvesters</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom:2.5rem; font-size:1.1rem;">
      Independent reviews and comparisons of AI tools — no hype, no paid placements.
    </p>

    <section style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        The AI software landscape changes faster than anyone can track. New tools launch daily, pricing shifts overnight,
        and last month's market leader is often replaced by a better alternative before you've even finished evaluating it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Ynvesters exists to give professionals a reliable, up-to-date reference. We publish in-depth reviews,
        side-by-side comparisons, and practical how-to guides so you can make confident decisions without
        spending hours on research yourself.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>
        Ynvesters is run by an independent editorial team with backgrounds in software engineering, product management,
        and technical writing. We test tools directly, read the official documentation, and cross-reference community
        feedback before we publish anything.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our editorial process starts with primary sources: official pricing pages, feature changelogs, developer
        documentation, and real user discussions. We do not accept sponsored reviews or paid placements.
        If a tool has a weakness, we say so.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <h2>What We Cover</h2>
      <ul style="line-height:2;">
        <li>AI coding assistants, writing tools, image generators, and productivity apps</li>
        <li>Head-to-head comparisons with objective, testable criteria</li>
        <li>Pricing breakdowns — including free tiers, limits, and hidden costs</li>
        <li>Step-by-step tutorials for getting real value out of new tools</li>
        <li>Analysis of major AI product launches and what they mean in practice</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
      <h2>Editorial Standards</h2>
      <p>
        Every factual claim in our articles is sourced from official documentation or a verifiable third-party reference.
        We link directly to primary sources — official product sites, GitHub repositories, academic papers — so you can
        verify anything we write.
      </p>
      <p>
        We update articles when products change. If you find an error or outdated information,
        please <a href="/contact">contact us</a> with a source link and we'll correct it within 48 hours.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="background:var(--color-bg2); border:1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius:10px; padding:1.5rem 2rem;">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Advertising Disclosure</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
        Ynvesters displays advertisements served by Google AdSense. Ad revenue helps us keep the site free and
        updated. Advertisers have no influence over our editorial coverage — our reviews and recommendations
        are written independently. For more information, see our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
